{
  "description": "AuthFI webhook conformance vectors, generated by scripts/gen-webhook-vectors.mjs: verify each delivery with `secret` at `now` (seconds) and `tolerance_seconds`. The signature is hex(HMAC-SHA256(secret, timestamp + \".\" + body)) as `sha256=<hex>` in X-AuthFI-Signature-256, as the platform's webhook dispatcher signs it. `expect` is `ok` or the refusal code. On ok cases `id` is the event id (UUIDv7, the same on every delivery of the event), `request_id` is the optional id of the request that caused it (null when the body has none; several events can share one) and `delivery_id` is X-AuthFI-Delivery. Headers are case-insensitive.",
